OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for abduction and sex
OL,4,Aassault of girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA girl who was abducted by two men when
OL,7,Fshe was 11 and sexually assaulted,
OL,8,Fafter thinking they were going to help
OL,9,Fher, has told a court she still has
OL,10,Fnightmares and flashbacks at what they
OL,11,Fdid.
OL,13,FHamza Sharif, 36, met the child in
OL,14,FBirmingham after she ran away from
OL,15,Fhome, invited her to a house where he
OL,16,Fand Sadak Ali offered her drugs.
OL,18,FWhen she refused, Ali, 28, asked her
OL,19,F"invasive" sexual questions and
OL,20,Fsexually assaulted her.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
