OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for abduction and sex
OL,4,Aassault of girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair were jailed on Thursday at
OL,7,FBirmingham Crown Court with the judge
OL,8,Fsaying they "isolated a vulnerable
OL,9,Fchild for a significant amount of
OL,10,Ftime".
